BIB                  3         12
REACTION   (12-MG-25(A,N)14-SI-28,,SGV)
ANALYSIS   The reaction rate in a stellar environment during
           thermonuclear burning processes can be calculated by
           integrating the reaction cross section over the
           Maxwell-Boltzmann energy distribution of the
           interacting particles. For the reaction rate
           calculation, authors added in a contribution for the
           ground state based on the HF calculations.
